13
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:26,967
Meet our debut title: Rotten Crown.

14
00:00:26,967 --> 00:00:28,650
Step into Thornfield.

15
00:00:28,983 --> 00:00:31,400
Face silent watchers at the gate.

16
00:00:31,733 --> 00:00:35,317
A dark-fantasy world where every shadow holds a story,

17
00:00:35,317 --> 00:00:36,867
